WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.130 --> 00:00:04.040
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and yesterday
in my City of Blood video I asked you all

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:07.140
to submit your biggest questions about the
episode and the rest of the season.

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:10.060
So we’re going to answer 10 of them with
one bonus question.

00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:12.080
There’s only two more episodes left in season
2 and the Starling City weather service is

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:15.490
predicting fire tornadoes with a heavy chance
of Apocalypse..

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:18.851
If you’re finding me for the first time
every week I do Q&amp;A videos like this for fun

00:00:18.851 --> 00:00:22.220
stuff just so I can feature questions you
guys leave me that I think are really interesting.

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:26.929
It’s also fun to follow up on WTF stuff
that happens during the week.

00:00:26.929 --> 00:00:28.220
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:31.199
I’ve even got some Spider-Man stuff coming
tomorrow!

00:00:31.199 --> 00:00:35.320
So time for questions, careful for spoilers
from episode 21 if you haven’t seen it yet.

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:36.320
Here we go.

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:40.940
Question 1 - SvenTuSventu asks What do you
think Oliver will call the new Foundry?

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:46.600
I’m expecting that he’ll call it the Arrowcave
in a twist of his reaction to Felicity back

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:49.240
when Roy joined.

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:51.110
He was all like “we do not call it that”.

00:00:51.110 --> 00:00:54.990
I’d really like for him to have a moment
where he caves, sorry for the word play, and

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:57.190
just calls it the new Arrowcave.

00:00:57.190 --> 00:01:00.970
The thing about the show is that Oliver is
always the straight man, that’s a comedy

00:01:00.970 --> 00:01:01.970
term.

00:01:01.970 --> 00:01:03.920
In a comedy sketch where you have two or more
people.

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:07.659
You’ll have one person who’s not in on
the joke and they’ll just react to the other

00:01:07.659 --> 00:01:09.030
people being silly.

00:01:09.030 --> 00:01:10.859
Saturday Night Live does it all the time.

00:01:10.859 --> 00:01:13.770
On Arrow, that’s Oliver, Felicity is the
goofy one and we always see Oliver frown at

00:01:13.770 --> 00:01:16.049
her when he doesn’t like her jokes.

00:01:16.049 --> 00:01:19.570
So when they let Oliver be silly on very very
rare occassions, it ends up being that much

00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:20.570
funnier.

00:01:20.570 --> 00:01:21.570
Because he’s always so serious.

00:01:21.570 --> 00:01:22.850
Thus, I want him to call it the new Arrowcave.

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:23.850
At least once.

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:28.770
Question 2 - Kofi asks do you think Merlyn
will take Thea under his wing and save her?

00:01:28.770 --> 00:01:33.270
He’ll definitely rescue her but I don’t
think Willa Holland is leaving the show, so

00:01:33.270 --> 00:01:34.899
she probably won’t go with him.

00:01:34.899 --> 00:01:40.090
In order to get that Merlyn Thea Artemis storyline,
she’d have to go away, because John Barrowman

00:01:40.090 --> 00:01:41.630
isn’t coming back to the show full time.

00:01:41.630 --> 00:01:45.319
So you’d have to have Willa leave the show
in the way Barry Allen left the show to go

00:01:45.319 --> 00:01:46.790
back to Central City.

00:01:46.790 --> 00:01:50.719
I think Thea will still be a full time cast
member in season 3, so she’s probably going

00:01:50.719 --> 00:01:51.810
to not go with him.

00:01:51.810 --> 00:01:56.469
That doesn’t mean Merlyn is going to die
or not come back in season 3.

00:01:56.469 --> 00:01:59.170
Characters are way more fun when they’re
haunted by evil parents.

00:01:59.170 --> 00:02:04.859
And now that Moira is gone, Merlyn is going
to fill that role.

00:02:04.859 --> 00:02:08.429
I expect him to pop in at least once or twice
next season.

00:02:08.429 --> 00:02:10.860
Or at least be referenced in conversation.

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:17.420
Laurel talks about Tommy with Oliver, so of
course Thea is going to talk to Oliver about

00:02:17.420 --> 00:02:18.420
her father.

00:02:18.420 --> 00:02:22.170
Question 3 - Austin (no avatar) asks Do you
think Nyssa will die in the finale and that

00:02:22.170 --> 00:02:24.760
will cause Ra’s Al Ghul to unleash on Starling
City?

00:02:24.760 --> 00:02:29.100
No, I think that Katrina Law is too precious
of an actor for them to get rid of her character.

00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:34.000
She’s the best representation of the League,
Ra’s and Talia that they could get without

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:36.570
having to deal with complicated continuity
issues.

00:02:36.570 --> 00:02:40.060
That’s why you don’t see more characters
jumping from show to show.

00:02:40.060 --> 00:02:41.670
Even Marvel only does it a little.

00:02:41.670 --> 00:02:45.620
So anytime they want to use the League as
a story device, they can bring her back.

00:02:45.620 --> 00:02:50.800
As for her relationship with Oliver and the
city, we’ll have to wait and see.

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:56.540
But she treats Oliver the way you’d treat
anyone who’s dating your ex.

00:02:56.540 --> 00:02:57.710
With a little bit of contempt.

00:02:57.710 --> 00:03:03.590
But I think she accepts what he represents,
so they’re not enemies.

00:03:03.590 --> 00:03:05.090
More like frenemies.

00:03:05.090 --> 00:03:07.080
I do like the idea of Oliver creating his
own villains.

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:09.420
That’s kind of what happened with Huntress
and Slade to a certain degree, although she

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:11.340
wasn’t really his enemy.

00:03:11.340 --> 00:03:14.320
Slade you could say is more of an enemy of
circumstance.

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:18.010
The only reason he’s doing this is because
of the mirakuru, so once they cure him.

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:20.040
His entire motivation will be gone.

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:23.870
I think that there will be a new villain at
some point that Oliver will be directly responsible

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:24.900
for creating.

00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:30.180
Remember the Michael Keaton Batman and his
relationship to the Jack Nicholson Joker.

00:03:30.180 --> 00:03:34.260
Joker shoots parents, Batman dumps Joker in
vat of chemicals.

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:35.260
I think Oliver will get a moment like that
eventually.

00:03:35.260 --> 00:03:36.260
Maybe not next season, but before the series
is over.

00:03:36.260 --> 00:03:37.260
I suppose you could argue that’s what’s
been going on this season, but Slade didn’t

00:03:37.260 --> 00:03:38.260
strand Oliver on the Island.

00:03:38.260 --> 00:03:41.280
Question 4 - Oliver Queen asks do you think
Brother Blood will have a change of heart

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:42.500
before the finale?

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:49.360
When Oliver made him face facts about Slade
there was a moment of hesitation on his face.

00:03:49.360 --> 00:03:53.820
But I think he’s committed himself to the
cause, he’s basically drinking his own mirakuru

00:03:53.820 --> 00:03:55.160
kool aide.

00:03:55.160 --> 00:03:58.020
Remember that shot of Laurel with the bow
from next week’s episode?

00:03:58.020 --> 00:04:00.540
I think she’s going to have the pleasure
of killing him.

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:03.250
I don’t really care how she does it, but
if she did kill him with the bow.

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:05.180
It would be pretty freaking sweet.

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:08.400
I think if any of the villains will die this
season, he’s the one.

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:13.569
Laurel has gone pretty dark, wiretapping him
without a warrant, breaking the law, using

00:04:13.569 --> 00:04:14.810
extortion to get her job back.

00:04:14.810 --> 00:04:27.210
I totally think she’s going to kill him
to save Oliver and the rest of Team Arrow.

00:04:27.210 --> 00:04:32.560
Question 5 - Sour Rooster asks if Sara dies,
do you think that Nyssa could become the Season

00:04:32.560 --> 00:04:34.380
3 villain?

00:04:34.380 --> 00:04:41.710
No, but if Sara does end up dying I think
she’ll flip out and kill a bunch of soldiers.

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:44.180
I don’t think she’d hold Sara’s death
against Oliver.

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:45.570
She wouldn’t waste her time on him.

00:04:45.570 --> 00:04:49.960
The League is from Nanda Parbat, but they’re
an international organization with operations

00:04:49.960 --> 00:04:51.800
going on all over the planet.

00:04:51.800 --> 00:04:54.570
So Starling City is a spec of dust in their
grand design.

00:04:54.570 --> 00:04:57.660
I would like to see her fight Slade.

00:04:57.660 --> 00:05:01.410
She and Oliver were basically an even match,
so she’d do at least as good against Slade

00:05:01.410 --> 00:05:02.520
as Oliver has done.

00:05:02.520 --> 00:05:04.270
I guess that doesn’t say much, because Oliver
has gotten the crap kicked out of him every

00:05:04.270 --> 00:05:07.000
time he’s fought Slade in close quarters.

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:11.970
Question 6 - Matchoman asks Did you see that
T statue in Brother Blood's Office?

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:15.230
How soon could a Teen Titans spinoff occur
and who would be a villain for them to handle?﻿

00:05:15.230 --> 00:05:18.460
Right now they’re still trying to get The
Flash show ordered to series.

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:21.000
We’ll know in about two weeks if that’s
going to happen.

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:22.220
By the middle of May.

00:05:22.220 --> 00:05:26.590
There’s like a 99 percent chance that’s
going to happen based on news from inside

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:28.180
the CW.

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:32.460
If The Flash TV Show ends up being really
successful they’ll start targeting new shows

00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:33.560
to develop.

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:37.790
Right now I think there’s a better chance
of a Suicide Squad show happening before anything

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:38.790
else.

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:41.760
Just because they’ve spent a lot of time
developing those characters from the villains

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:44.030
on the team, to Amanda Waller who’s like
the main character.

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:47.620
In order for them to do Teen Titans they have
to fully develop a protagonist like Roy.

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:48.800
Then at least two other team members like
Sin and Thea.

00:05:48.800 --> 00:05:49.800
And those people would have to leave Arrow.

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:52.860
So I don’t think Arrow is going to let go
of Willa Holland or Colton Haynes anytime

00:05:52.860 --> 00:05:53.860
soon.

00:05:53.860 --> 00:06:01.030
So no Teen Titans for the foreseeable future.

00:06:01.030 --> 00:06:04.880
Question 7 - Pastor Will asks What do you
think he meant when Oliver say that they started

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:08.390
with just those three and they needed to get
back to that?

00:06:08.390 --> 00:06:10.160
I think he was talking more about the finale.

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:13.570
I think they’ll end up with the three of
them versus Slade.

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:19.020
I don’t think Ravager or Brother Blood will
be in the final fight.

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:23.250
Question 8 - Eric Jaffa (no avatar) asks Who
do you think Isabel Rochev’s hallucinating

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:25.889
since she’s full of mirakuru now too?

00:06:25.889 --> 00:06:31.230
Good question, usually the person everyone
hallucinates is someone they had a sexual

00:06:31.230 --> 00:06:32.610
relationship with.

00:06:32.610 --> 00:06:34.830
Or in Slade’s situation, a person they had
sexual feelings for.

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:40.810
But in her case, I think she’s hallucinating
Diggle, just because he’s the one that visited

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:42.470
her trauma on her.

00:06:42.470 --> 00:06:43.570
As in killed her.

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:47.080
And it seems like her main goal right now
is to get revenge for that.

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:53.050
I think both she and Brother Blood have what
they want, they got what Slade promised them.

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:57.650
So at this point, they’re just along for
the ride.

00:06:57.650 --> 00:07:01.080
It’s like they won the lottery and now they’re
just trying to figure out what to spend all

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:07.310
the cash on.

00:07:07.310 --> 00:07:11.770
Question 9 - Jerry Chan asks do you think
Laurel could become Artemis instead of Black

00:07:11.770 --> 00:07:13.310
Canary?

00:07:13.310 --> 00:07:18.080
I totally think that’s a possibility but
I think that’s a whole new character arc

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:19.639
that would have to wait till season 3.

00:07:19.639 --> 00:07:23.420
She’s definitely going to be a more active
member of team Arrow in season 3, but I think

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:26.389
most of her time will be spent in a support
role like Felicity.

00:07:26.389 --> 00:07:30.979
She’ll probably train just because she seems
less physically awkward than Felicity but

00:07:30.979 --> 00:07:32.600
she’ll never be as vicious as Sara.

00:07:32.600 --> 00:07:37.360
So what I’m hoping is that Sara will survive
the finale and just go back to the League

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:40.960
with Nyssa, but she’ll help Oliver train
her.

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:43.560
We just won’t see a lot of that on screen.

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:48.050
But I do expect Oliver to have some bow training
scenes with Laurel next year.

00:07:48.050 --> 00:07:51.990
I definitely think Team Arrow needs more girl
power to balance out all the dudes.

00:07:51.990 --> 00:07:54.669
It’s a bit of a sausage fest right now.

00:07:54.669 --> 00:07:59.130
And as much as Felicity is Oliver’s conscience,
Laurel is more of an equal.

00:07:59.130 --> 00:08:11.699
Not so much in a physical sense, but in that
she wields as much authority as a character.

00:08:11.699 --> 00:08:16.150
Question 10 - Jonah asks Do you think the
Suicide Squad will help deal with the Mirakuru

00:08:16.150 --> 00:08:17.150
army?

00:08:17.150 --> 00:08:21.000
Yes, there’s no way they’re going to be
able to subdue all those super soldiers by

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:22.000
themselves.

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:25.520
That image we say of Nyssa in the finale implies
that the League won’t be back until that

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:27.270
episode.

00:08:27.270 --> 00:08:36.770
Which means Oliver is going to have to get
more help next week.

00:08:36.770 --> 00:08:44.150
Bonus Question - JY9012 asks Is Roy coming
back in the next episode and will he be cured?

00:08:44.150 --> 00:08:45.920
Frankenstein has to wake up at some point.

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:48.230
They certainly teased it enough this week.

00:08:48.230 --> 00:08:52.980
I think that once they have the cure they’ll
fix Roy first and then figure out how to deliver

00:08:52.980 --> 00:08:54.030
the cure to the rest of the super soldiers.

00:08:54.030 --> 00:08:59.490
I know a lot of you have also been asking
about Roy’s Arsenal costume.

00:08:59.490 --> 00:09:07.200
Stephen Amell did say that there would be
one more costume featured this year.

00:09:07.200 --> 00:09:10.400
Based on recent developments I think he was
talking about Ravager.

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:13.440
In order for Roy to get a suit, Oliver would
have to make it.

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:17.060
And right now he’s underneath a pile of
concrete trapped with a bunch of super soldiers.

00:09:17.060 --> 00:09:21.210
So he’s not going to be able to sew any
red leather pants for a long time.

00:09:21.210 --> 00:09:23.080
So thanks so much for submitting your questions.

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:24.620
These are always a ton of fun to do.

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:26.290
Like I said, there’s only two more episodes
left.

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:27.290
Be sure to subscribe to get my videos.

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:32.460
I’ll post my next Arrow bonus video wednesday
before episode 22 airs.

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:36.490
Feel free to leave me suggestions for what
that should be about.

00:09:36.490 --> 00:09:40.089
Right now click here to for my review of the
episode and click here to learn more about

00:09:40.089 --> 00:09:41.400
the Justice League Movie.

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:43.640
Thanks for watching, see you guys tomorrow.

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:44.280
High Fives!

